<p>You freeze yourself in time for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">3, 3, 4, 5, 5</acronym> turns, preventing you from taking any action but preventing any damage taken.</p><p>Negative effects and cooldowns will decrease in duration, while beneficial effects will remain at their current duration.</p>